msgstr "Opções"

#: src/toolbox/selection/rectangle.xml:284(title)
#: src/toolbox/selection/iscissors.xml:201(title)
#: src/toolbox/selection/fuzzy.xml:135(title)
#: src/toolbox/selection/free.xml:181(title)
